# Maintainer-only digests for the Arch repository databases.
# install/stick/maint-pin-arch.py checks these bytes before it parses a database.
# make-maint.sh fetch and assemble do not read this file. They use maint.pins only.
#   <sha256-lowercase> <size-bytes> <name> <https-url>
# name is core.db or extra.db. The date is the date in the URL.

